      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Guaxinim Minúsculo. Zigzagoon caminha em zigue-zague. Ele é muito habilidoso em encontrar objetos escondidos na grama e até debaixo da terra.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/4 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Zigzagoon pode evoluir para Linoone no nível 7 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Growl, Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Tail Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Sand Attack</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Baby-Doll Eyes, Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Odor Sleuth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Mud Sport</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Pin Missile</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Covet</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Bestow</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Flail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Take Down</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Double-Edge, Rest</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Belly Drum</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Fling</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Attract, Blizzard, Charge Beam, Charm, Confide, Covet, Dig, Double Team, Echoed Voice, Facade, Fling, Frustration, Grass Knot, Gunk Shot, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Hyper Voice, Ice Beam, Icy Wind, Iron Tail, Last Resort, Mud Shot, Pin Missile, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Retaliate, Return, Round, Seed Bomb, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Sunny Day, Super Fang, Surf, Swagger, Swift, Tail Slap, Thief, Thunder, Thunder Wave, Thunderbolt, Toxic, Trick, Water Pulse, Whirlpool, Work Up</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Charm, Extreme Speed, Helping Hand, Mud-Slap, Pursuit, Rock Climb, Simple Beam, Sleep Talk, Tickle, Trick</p>",
